# Crossroads_11_alt after the Elder Baldur is dead: west over the ledges to the gate into Fungus1_01 (the Terrain Block's box x 73..78 is open once he is dead).
# Planned with hk-walkplan room on the disc (HK_WALKPLAN_MARGIN=0.4, sync poll), from the card crossroads-11-alt-east.mcd with the Baldur round as the pre fragment, every jump in a retry loop
# (hk-walkplan room, 2026-11-03). The exit is waited for by the next room's arrival.
at 82.30 11.39
loop x-t3-h001 until expr abs(i32(HK_PLAYER_X) - 4885709) <= 58982 && abs(i32(HK_PLAYER_Y) - 746455) <= 19661 max 3 timeout 900
walk 79.26
walk 79.69   # run-up
walk 79.26   # take-off
hold left+cross for 12
hold left for 22
wait 6
wait until HK_WALK_READY == 1 timeout 300
end
